(@o_vip_microsites+10, @o_users+98, @cities_1, @vip_plans_5, 'Pinnacle Academy', 'Education', 'Coaching Institute (Class 6–12, JEE & NEET)', 'Prof. Manoj Tripathi', 'pinnacle-academy', 'Pinnacle Academy limits every batch to 30 students so each child gets attention.\n\nOur faculty of 14 includes IIT and NIT alumni. Weekly tests, doubt sessions every evening and a monthly parent-teacher meeting keep progress visible. 63 of our students cleared JEE Main last year.', 'Small-batch coaching for Classes 6–12, JEE and NEET with weekly tests and parent reports.', '2011', '14HAI2I840971Z9', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/demo/year/coaching/logo.svg', 'uploads/demo/year/coaching/about.jpg', 'coaching@demo.globallife.co.in', '9935067712', NULL, '9935067712', NULL, '2nd Floor, Elite Complex, Elite Chauraha, Jhansi, Uttar Pradesh 284001', 'https://maps.google.com/?q=Pinnacle+Academy%2C+Jhansi', '{\"monday\":{\"open\":\"07:00\",\"close\":\"20:00\",\"closed\":false},\"tuesday\":{\"open\":\"07:00\",\"close\":\"20:00\",\"closed\":false},\"wednesday\":{\"open\":\"07:00\",\"close\":\"20:00\",\"closed\":false},\"thursday\":{\"open\":\"07:00\",\"close\":\"20:00\",\"closed\":false},\"friday\":{\"open\":\"07:00\",\"close\":\"20:00\",\"closed\":false},\"saturday\":{\"open\":\"07:00\",\"close\":\"20:00\",\"closed\":false},\"sunday\":{\"open\":\"07:00\",\"close\":\"20:00\",\"closed\":true}}', NULL, 'https://facebook.com/', 'https://instagram.com/', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"videos\":false,\"banner\":true,\"about\":true,\"stats\":true,\"shop\":true,\"services\":true,\"products\":true,\"gallery\":true,\"reviews\":true,\"contact\":true,\"faqs\":true,\"social_media\":true,\"float_whatsapp\":true,\"float_call\":true,\"float_direction\":true,\"float_email\":true}', NULL, 'XKPD1YO', 'active', '2026-03-23 15:36:00', '2026-12-23 15:36:00', '2026-03-23 15:36:00', '2026-09-17 15:15:00'),
